Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:14:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Stretched fullscreen and finger long press = right button

- Setting 'Fullscreen: stretch the game to the whole display' (default on):
  when Fullscreen is on, borderless game windows smaller than the X screen
  are stretched to the whole screen ignoring aspect ratio (reuses the
  Force Fullscreen window transformation, so pointer events map correctly);
  turning Fullscreen off restores 1:1 mapping.
- Setting 'Long finger press = right mouse button' (default on): one finger
  held still for the long-press time presses RMB (cursor synced to the
  finger) until lifted; moving or a second finger cancels; short tap = LMB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
